WEBVTT

00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:30.583
was our beautiful boy.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:34.625
I remember when we first
brought Sekou home.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.434
It was so exciting, it was amazing,

00:05:37.458 --> 00:05:39.268
we worked together, we collaborated,

00:05:39.292 --> 00:05:40.643
we supported each other.

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:44.309
You took the night shift,
I took the morning shift.

00:05:44.333 --> 00:05:46.083
And it was going amazing.

00:05:47.667 --> 00:05:49.250
And then it all changed.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:54.268
It changed the morning that you came in
really excited, you was like,

00:05:54.292 --> 00:05:56.351
"Hey, I'm going back to work!

00:05:56.375 --> 00:05:57.875
Aren't you excited?"

00:05:58.917 --> 00:06:02.226
And I was like, "Yes.
I am ecstatic right now.